<notes>
NoteIn the first sample the only possible answer is:sIn the second sample one of the possible solutions is: rdlruls denotes command "stay idle", l, r, d, u denote commands "crawl left", "crawl right", "crawl down", "crawl up", correspondingly.
</notes>

